Package: nxd-retrobox
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Manuel Jesús Romero Mateos <manu4.2012@gmail.com>
Section: games
Priority: optional
Depends: nxd-common (= @VERSION@), openbox, picom, pulseaudio-utils, dosfstools, util-linux, mount
Homepage: https://github.com/manu-romero-411/nx-debian
Description: Debian on the Nintendo Switch: the Retrobox console
 The system files of the nx-debian Retrobox image: its Openbox session
 (nxd-retrobox, with the picom compositor), Retrobox's settings for the
 Switch (console mode, ROMs, BIOS and saves on the SD card), the SD card's
 FAT32 partition mounted in /sdcard, the volume and power buttons, and the
 default EmulationStation pad and text size.
